   "text": "line in ## Release slice: O - matches the keyed frame ('declared\nin the Release slice definition'); nothing invented.\nfront-matter key: X - a third key breaks the route/stage\nboth-or-nothing pair.\nnew ## Rigor section: X - empty until slice 2; RESERVED as the\ndisposition table's home, nothing built for it now.",
