   "customData": {
    "gen": "kerd"
   },
   "roundness": null,
   "text": "Tony's key 2026-08-05:\na level is one falsifiable\nvalue - it cannot be\nhollow the way a\nreconstructed reading\nlist can.\n\nproposed, annotate if\ndishonest: all four mvp\n(push-wiring, grounding-\nwas-read, progress-html,\nrigor-level).",
   "fontSize": 12,
   "fontFamily": 6,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "originalText": "Tony's key 2026-08-05:\na level is one falsifiable\nvalue - it cannot be\nhollow the way a\nreconstructed reading\nlist can.\n\nproposed, annotate if\ndishonest: all four mvp\n(push-wiring, grounding-\nwas-read, progress-html,\nrigor-level).",
