   "roundness": null,
   "text": "stage-1 measurements,\nANSWERED:\n\nundeclared level at a tip\n-> AU6 red within one CI\nrun, fix named.\n\nthree done journeys'\nboard render -> unchanged:\nsame-commit retrofit,\nroute pre/post identical,\nstale harness byte-compare.",
